WEBVTT

00:08:59.081 --> 00:09:02.073
polovica prestrašena zaradi sevanja,

00:09:02.073 --> 00:09:05.210
polovica pa ga bo ignorirala.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.061
Psihoanalitiki dobro vedo,

00:09:08.061 --> 00:09:10.623
da ljudje začuda

00:09:10.623 --> 00:09:12.828
ne čutijo strasti do znanja,

00:09:12.828 --> 00:09:15.057
temveč do neznanja.

00:09:15.057 --> 00:09:17.139
Kaj to pomeni?

00:09:17.139 --> 00:09:19.634
Recimo, da nas ogroža

00:09:19.634 --> 00:09:21.660
smrtno nevarna bolezen,

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:24.223
veliko ljudi tega noče vedeti.

00:09:24.223 --> 00:09:28.189
Raje zanikajo bolezen,

00:09:28.189 --> 00:09:31.727
zato jih ni pametno obveščati,